#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apps for the App Center"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"__As of: 2026-11-04 · OpenEMS version 2026.12.0-SNAPSHOT (development "
"version, branch develop)__"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"An app is the guided setup of a function in the App Center. It shows a form, "
"creates components from the inputs and enters Controllers in the Scheduler. "
"The control logic itself is not in the app, but in the component it creates "
"(see xref:development/implementing/controller.adoc[Implementing a "
"Controller]). `+FixActivePower+` (small, one Controller), "
"`+AppWeatherPrediction+` (checks before installation) and `+AppHeatMyPv+` "
"(number fields) serve as templates."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where apps are located"
msgstr ""

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"Apps are OSGi components in the bundle `+io.openems.edge.core+`, source code "
"under `+src/io/openems/edge/app/<area>/+`. The framework is in "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.appmanager+`."
msgstr ""

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"**UI:** The form comes as a JSON description from the Edge "
"(`+getAppAssistant+`). For a new app, nothing needs to be changed in `+ui/+` "
"and no new UI build is necessary."
msgstr ""

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"**No separate bundle:** The core bundle only releases the package "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.price+` (`+Export-Package+` in the manifest). Another "
"bundle therefore cannot import the classes under `+appmanager+`. A new app "
"therefore means a new Edge JAR; it cannot be installed individually, for "
"example via FileInstall."
msgstr ""

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"**No registration:** The `+AppManagerImpl+` dynamically binds all OSGi "
"services of type `+OpenemsApp+` (`+bindApp+`). There is no app list."
msgstr ""

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
msgid ""
"**Component:** The app only names the component as text via its Factory-ID. "
"The bundle of the component must also be in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+`, otherwise it "
"is missing from the JAR."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "What belongs to an app"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| What\n"
"| Where\n"
"\n"
"| App class\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.core/src/io/openems/edge/app/<area>/+`\n"
"| Translations\n"
"| `+…/core/appmanager/translation_de.properties+` and `+translation_en.properties+`\n"
"| Scheduler order, if the app creates a Controller\n"
"| `+ProductionSchedulerOrderDefinition+` in `+…/appmanager/dependency/aggregatetask/SchedulerByCentralOrderAggregateTaskImpl.java+`\n"
"| Website link\n"
"| `+io.openems.common/src/io/openems/common/oem/DummyOpenemsEdgeOem.java+`\n"
"| Image (optional)\n"
"| `+<ClassName>.png+` next to the app class\n"
"| Test helpers and tests\n"
"| `+test/…/core/appmanager/Apps.java+`, `+TestTranslations.java+`, own test\n"
msgstr ""

